# TypeScript Strict Typing Rules

## Core Principle

Code MUST be fully type-safe. The use of `any` is prohibited.

## Forbidden

### Do NOT use `any`

❌ Bad

```ts
function process(data: any): any {
  return data;
}

const result: any = await api.get();